"backup frequency schedule and can have as many Instances backing up under"
" it as needed"
msgstr ""
"**Backup Job Type:** Clone un existente backup job (Backups > Jobs) o add"
" este backup to un existente job. A job contains un retention count y "
"backup frequency schedule y puede tienen as muchos Instances backing up "
"under it según sea necesario"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/veeam.rst:77
msgid ""
"**Backup Job:** Select the job which will be cloned or have a backup "
